# armour/<body>/skirt_hauberk: HAUBERK, a straight mail skirt in metal-2 courses (N between) with a front
# slit, on a body that is not mail (a mail torso draws its own knee skirt: the base views are empty); its
# lower courses hang behind the legs to mid-shin (skirt_hauberk_back), a straight column to 1x.
# Generated from the FORGE-LIMBS skirt templates (gen_skirts2.py, skirts_def.py; iteration 2: the D view serves U, `tags anyfacing`); Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role overlay skirt.hauberk
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
tags anyfacing
z 10

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view D key rest origin 9 0 when !form-mail replace
|.vyzyyyyyyxxxwwwv.
|.vxxxxxxwwwwwwwwv.
|.vwwwwwvvvwwwwwvv.
|.vyyxxwv..vyyxxwv.
|.vyyxxwv..vyyxxwv.
|.vvvvvvv..vvvvvvv.
regions
|..................
|..................
|..NNNNNN..NNNNNN..
|..................
|..RRRRR....RRRRR..
|..................

